      "rationale": "This rule executes the verification entry point by turning #runMultiply on two integers into an ordinary call of the modeled Python closure.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-4a53979712cc9f4bc859fe5870bc02792a9f2614c0ffbd65fb212ab383807457",
      "start_line": 23,
      "text": "  rule <k> #runMultiply(A:Int, B:Int)\n        => Call(multiplyClosure, A, B) ... </k>"
    }
